# A Mermaid gallery

One cell for each of the diagram types a documentation card uses most. Back to
[[index]].

## Sequence

```mermaid#show
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Author
  participant P as Preview
  participant R as Renderer
  U->>P: edits a cell
  loop each diagram cell
    P->>R: source on stdin
    alt the source draws
      R-->>P: SVG
    else it does not
      R-->>P: the reason
    end
  end
  Note over P,R: bounded to 2 s
```

## Class

```mermaid#show
classDiagram
  class Engine {
    +String name
    +render(source) Result
  }
  class D2Engine
  class MermaidEngine
  Engine <|-- D2Engine
  Engine <|-- MermaidEngine
  Engine "1" o-- "64" Result : caches
```

## Entity relationship

```mermaid#show
erDiagram
  VAULT ||--o{ CARD : holds
  CARD ||--o{ CELL : contains
  CARD {
    string path PK
    string title
  }
  CELL {
    int index
    string kind
  }
```

## Gantt

```mermaid#show
gantt
  title Mermaid on par with D2
  dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
  section Tools
  Fence kinds :a1, 2026-11-25, 1d
  Engines :a2, after a1, 1d
  section Ship
  Toolchain :b1, after a2, 2d
```

## Pie

